-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(For someone like me, to whom it takes couple min to figure out what is wrong with a line :)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">Vilmos</span></div></div>"
